I left out both operations requests. The node's `with` clause grants only `aap:caps/state-read@0.1.0`, so it has no filesystem for the log file and no `http-client` import for the metadata service. Adding either would exceed the node's authority. If operations needs them, the graph's `with` clause has to grant those capabilities first, for example an `http-client` scoped to `metadata.internal.example`.

